      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "None of these sketches rely on obvious clichés like the loner genius or the sidekick, but Andre leans slightly into the generic \"young criminal wannabe\" trope. For your settings, Julian and Elena would fit perfectly in a polished high-society drama due to their elite backgrounds, while Marcus and Andre align well with a gritty urban crime drama thanks to their street-level worldview. Hiroshi bridges both genres but might feel more at home in the crime story as a tech expert. These characters show good diversity, though be cautious of adding excessive adjectives like \"smart\" or \"elegant\" without specific context to avoid sounding generic.",
      "source": "target",
